{"id":"n20279-1-4","stage":0,"title":"하나 · 一","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20279-1-4-1","ko":"볼펜 하나만 빌려줘.","zh":"借我一支圆珠笔吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"볼펜","meaning":"圆珠笔","explanation":"볼펜：圆珠笔","readings":[{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59469","senseId":"1","lemma":"볼펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나만","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빌려줘.","meaning":"借；给予，给","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：给予，给；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4ba73c1f13e77796","term":"볼펜","zh":"圆珠笔","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3","entryId":"59469","definition":"笔尖的小钢珠随着笔的移动一起滚动、同时带出墨水来写字的一种书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3d4c84c0dad9ebf7ff83.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20279-1-4-2","ko":"응, 여기 있어.","zh":"嗯，给你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readin